WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
AI operating models improve when teams clarify which decisions matter.

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:10.000
Accountability and evidence should be designed before individual tasks are automated.

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Teams should measure the consequences of the changed decision after deployment.
